.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
config.toml
# tokens.json* not tokens.json: save() writes tokens.json.tmp before renaming,
# and a crash inside that window leaves a live two-week refresh token behind
# that the exact-name pattern would not have caught. This repo is public.
tokens.json*
*.tmp
data/
# data_dir is configurable, so telemetry can land outside data/, where the
# `data/` rule above does not reach. These patterns cover the rest of what the
# agent writes -- with data_dir = "telemetry", `git add -A` would otherwise
# stage the rendered map (both VINs and every fix in it), the coordinate log,
# and the heartbeat.
*.jsonl
*.log
*.err
viz/map.html
stream.status
stream.lock
catalogue.json
